OL,3,ATate brothers charged with further
OL,4,Atrafficking and sex crimes in Romania
OL,5,
OL,6,FRomanian prosecutors have charged
OL,7,Fsocial media influencers Andrew and
OL,8,FTristan Tate with further sex crimes.
OL,10,FThey are accused of making more than
OL,11,F$1.2m (#888,000) by coercing a girl to
OL,12,Fdo sex acts on video chats, according
OL,13,Fto the Romanian Directorate for
OL,14,FInvestigating Crime and Terrorism
OL,15,F(DIICOT).
OL,17,FAndrew, 39, is charged with trafficking
OL,18,Fminors, money laundering and sex with a
OL,19,Fminor. Tristan, 38, is charged with
OL,20,Fcomplicity in trafficking in minors and
OL,21,Fmoney laundering.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
